\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cYHSkb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GuGTe3L.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5EiwS3H.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"40\"><br><img src=\"https://imgur.com/aHc4S93.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/aK7ykEb.png\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pwwoJoz.png\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/uvtNHb5.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VYJzkYE.png\" width=\"51\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sKvQO1d.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0bzO6jP.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IyD3iA5.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmLbhkJ.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Just Potion Rings 是一個靈感來自 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-fingers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Potion Fingers</a> 的模組，這個模組將每一種生物效果（狀態效果）都轉化為一枚戒指，</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">即使你安裝了會新增更多效果的模組，</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Just Potion Rings 也會</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">為新的生物效果添加對應的戒指。</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">請參閱Wiki了解：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Recipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">合成配方</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/LootChest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">戰利品箱</a> /&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Trades\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">交易</a> /&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Commands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">指令</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki#compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">相容性</a>&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Datapack#how-to-create-a-ring-recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">如何通過資料包製作戒指配方</a></span></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/nNw9qcQ.gif\" width=\"413\" height=\"233\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hEo18QI.gif\" width=\"413\" height=\"233\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lm1AP06.gif\" width=\"413\" height=\"233\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9A1aRWs.gif\" width=\"413\" height=\"233\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>常見問題解答（F.A.Q.）</strong></span></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：我可以把 Just Potion Rings 放進我的模組包裡嗎？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：當然可以，只需將我的模組放入相關作品中即可。<br><strong>問：在原生遊戲體驗中，我可以獲得多少種戒指？</strong><br>答：在原生遊戲體驗中只能獲得 13 種戒指。請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a> 以了解合成配方和其他取得戒指的方法。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：為什麼 Forge 1.21.x 版本的 Just Potion Rings 尚未推出？</strong><br>答：目前還沒有 Curios 1.21.x 的版本，你可以<a href=\"https://github.com/TheIllusiveC4/Curios/issues/427\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此</a>查看原因。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：我要如何為其他藥水效果製作更多配方？這適用於模組的藥水效果嗎？</strong><br>答：你可以通過資料包製作配方，請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a> 了解如何製作，而且它確實適用於由模組創建的藥水效果。</span></p>",
